{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is near, grab it, check its properties. Then, if near the destination, move there. Scan surroundings, do specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsRobotNearDestination    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
